{
 "name": "Edgeville piece step 14a: the Stronghold of Security's fourth floor. Down the Pit of Pestilence's dripping vine, back up the Boney ladder, the portal refused before the Cradle, the notice, the Cradle of Life once (the Stamp emote, fancy boots) and again (fighting boots), the portal to it, a pair of portals of death passed without a question once it is claimed, and up a bone chain to the start of the floor (::keys on)",
 "account": "test",
